  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_sunbr",
      "name": {
        "en": "Gummy's Badge",
        "zh": "古米证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Gummy has demonstrated the capacity for simultaneously treating allied forces while holding the battlefront.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Defender Operator during field operations to exercise Guardian responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员古米在维持战线的同时为友军提供医疗支援\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为重装干员，行使守护者职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_sunbr",
      "name": {
        "en": "Медовые Пряники",
        "zh": "蜜糖馅饼礼包",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_sunbr",
      "description": {
        "en": "With all manner of spices at the ready, and rye flour filling the place with the aroma of grains, Lada rolls up her sleeves and learns to make her babushka's most prized dessert under her babushka's own instruction—lovely, sweet honey spice cakes.\nShe knows her plan. She's going to put lots of sweet, sweet honey inside them, with extra jam and fresh, crunchy nuts. She's decided she's going to make them really big, and share them with all the people she loves. That way, everyone can eat to their heart's content, and every bite will be super sweet.\nWhat could possibly beat taking what you love, and sharing it with who you love?\n............\n'Let's get our stuff ready to move, Lada. It's gotten bad. We can't stay in the school any longer.'\nOn hearing what Sonya says as she enters the classroom, Lada hops to it without needing to think, following her leader with not a moment's hesitation.\n'Sure, I'll pack everything now.'\n'Hold on, Lada.' Anna, to her side, calls her to a halt and hands her half a honey spice cake. 'You should eat something too. Essentially all of the school's food has been torched. We're lucky you were concealing this spice cake in the first place...'\n'Hell of a big one, too! And sweet!'\nRosalind laughs boisterously from behind Sonya, followed by Natalya joining in the praise. 'Just a single bite silences the hunger. We were blessed to have you, Lada.'\n'Damn right,' Sonya nods, before furrowing her brow and addressing her directly, 'but you're barely eating anything. You've just been splitting with the rest of us. Didn't you share your cookies with some other guys too?'\nEat some more, Lada. They practically push the food into her hands.\nLada cups half a spice cake in her hands, not daring to blink, and turns to face away from the other girls in the room.\nThe Little Cub sniffles as quietly as she can, squeezing out the tears in her eyes and wiping them away. She presses her cracked lips together and lifts the spice cake up. She mimes a small biting motion, her teeth carefully shaving just a tiny bit from the top, the smallest possible bit of pastry and filling, and holds it in her mouth.\nSo sweet.\nHow can something be so sweet? She's never had a spice cake so delicious before.\n'Alright! I took a biiig, big bite!'\nLada turns back around, stuffing the spice cake into her bag and meeting the girls' concerned gazes with a smile.\n'It's true! I put lots and lots of honey in when I made it! Now I'm ready to go, I'm not hungry at all anymore!'\nAs long as she can be with the others, the Little Cub thinks to herself, no matter what she does, she won't have to suffer, or get tired, or fear anything ever again.",
        "zh": "准备好各式各样的香料，还有散发着粮食香气的黑面粉，拉达在奶奶的指点下，挽起衣袖学习制作奶奶最擅长的甜品——香香甜甜的蜜糖馅饼。\n拉达打定主意，要在馅饼里面加上好多好多香香甜甜的蜜糖，馅料里还要多加果酱和新鲜松脆的果仁。她决定要把蜜糖馅饼做得大大的，然后和所有她喜欢的人一起分着吃，这样一来，每个人就都能吃得心满意足，每一口就都能甜蜜非常。\n还有什么能比得上拿自己喜欢的东西，和自己喜欢的人一起分享呢？\n…………\n“拉达，准备收拾东西吧，情况太糟，我们不能再在学校等下去了。”\n听到走进教室的领头姐姐索尼娅这么说，拉达想也未想，立刻乖乖地答应下来。\n“好，拉达这就去收拾。”\n“等一下，拉达。”一边的安娜姐姐喊住她，递给她半块蜜糖馅饼，“你也吃点东西吧，学校里的食物基本都被烧光了，多亏你还一直藏着这块蜜糖馅饼……”\n“而且它还这么大，这么甜！”\n跟在索尼娅姐姐身后的罗莎琳姐姐大声笑起来，娜塔莉娅姐姐则夸奖她：“只要吃一口，立刻就不会饿了，多亏有你呢，拉达。”\n“确实。”索尼娅姐姐先是点头，然后又皱眉，“不过，拉达你都没怎么吃吧，之前也光顾着准备我们的份，还把自己的饼干也分给其他人了吧？”\n你多吃一点。姐姐们把食物都塞到她手中。\n拉达捧着半块蜜糖馅饼，不敢眨眼，转过身背对着屋内的姐姐们。\n小熊尽量小声地抽了抽鼻子，将挤出眼眶的泪花抹掉。她抿了抿干裂的嘴唇，将馅饼举起，做了一个咬的动作，牙齿小心地从馅饼上刮下一点点，一小点点饼皮和馅，抿在口中。\n好甜好甜。\n怎么会这么甜呀，她从没吃过这么好吃的馅饼。\n“好啦！拉达已经咬了一大口了！”\n拉达转过身，将手中的馅饼塞进包里，用笑容回应姐姐们担忧的注视。\n“是真的！拉达做馅饼的时候放了好多好多蜜糖，拉达现在好有精神，已经一点也不饿啦！”\n只要能和姐姐们在一起，小熊心想，那她做什么都不觉得苦不觉得累，她就什么都不怕啦。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
